{"id":"tristeza","lemma":"tristeza","pos":"noun","rank":2501,"glosses":["sadness (state or emotion of being sad)","sadness (event causing sadness)","tristeza (plant disease)"],"ipa":"/tɾiʃˈte.zɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tristezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-tristeza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esqueça as tristezas.","en":"Forget your sorrows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/843832","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"esquecer"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ela me mirou com tristeza.","en":"She looked sadly at me.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},null,{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Esquece as tuas tristezas.","en":"Forget your sorrows.","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"esquecer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hey","l":"teu"},null]},{"text":"Meu coração encheu-se de tristeza.","en":"My heart was filled with sorrow.","words":[{"g":"my, mine"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to fill, fill up","l":"encher"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Nossos corações estão cheios de tristeza.","en":"Our hearts are full of sadness.","words":[{"g":"our kin"},{"g":"heart","l":"coração"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full","l":"cheio"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}